# ./.dockerignore - Aggressive version to ensure a small build context

# --- FORCE IGNORE THESE EVERYWHERE ---

# The leading slash makes the pattern relative to the root of the context

# These are the most likely culprits for a large build context

/.venv
/venv
/node_modules
/build
/cache
/vcpkg

# Using the double-star glob pattern is a robust fallback

**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/**pycache** \*_/_.pyc

# --- Git and Editor Config ---

.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vscode
.idea
Streamtario.code-workspace

# --- Secrets ---

.env
.env.\*
\*.env
google_client_secret.json

# --- Build Artifacts ---

**/build
**/dist
\*.egg-info
package-lock.json

# --- Local Scripts & Config ---

fly.toml
update-secrets.ps1
requirements-dev.txt

# --- Exclude Non-Backend Apps ---

/apps/frontend
/apps/state-tracker-service
/apps/torrserver-daemon
/apps/streaming-service
/apps/webview2-host

# --- Other Local Dev Folders ---

local_dev_deps/
dev_resources/

# --- Docs & Misc ---

_.md
LICENSE
_.exe
